WEBVTT

00:00.034 --> 00:05.472
As for the dream-filled Tomorrow,

00:05.506 --> 00:10.842
No one can see it...

00:13.013 --> 00:18.576
I close my eyes and think of you,

00:19.253 --> 00:25.021
Who I'll meet someday...

00:25.459 --> 00:31.489
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:31.865 --> 00:38.236
Show the spring to these eyes of mine.

00:38.539 --> 00:44.671
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:45.045 --> 00:51.177
Farewell to the city in winter.

00:51.485 --> 00:57.856
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

00:58.258 --> 01:04.561
Call the spring to my heart.

01:04.832 --> 01:11.135
Flower of the wind, please bloom.

01:11.372 --> 01:17.675
Farewell, snow flakes.

01:34.495 --> 01:35.962
Whoa...

01:49.676 --> 01:50.734
Yes.

01:50.778 --> 01:56.512
Um, uh... It's Kikuchi...
My name's Kikuchi Yume. Um...

01:59.820 --> 02:00.980
Angela!

02:05.993 --> 02:07.290
You look like
you're ready to cry.

02:07.795 --> 02:12.789
Because meeting with
Master Chief Ginpun sounds scary...

02:13.367 --> 02:15.995
I'm living with him
under the same roof.

02:21.942 --> 02:24.410
Um... Thank you.

02:24.445 --> 02:29.075
Thank you so much,
for summoning me here today. Um...

02:29.583 --> 02:31.050
Kikuchi Yume-san?

02:31.318 --> 02:32.046
Yes!

02:40.094 --> 02:41.527
How do you do?

02:42.062 --> 02:44.030
How do you do?
I'm Kikuchi Yume.

02:44.498 --> 02:46.022
Thank you for coming
all this way.

02:47.101 --> 02:49.035
Miniature roses...

02:49.069 --> 02:52.266
The flowers your
mother likes, correct?

02:53.907 --> 02:56.034
Is Kikuchi Etsuko-san well?

02:56.677 --> 02:59.043
What?
You know my mother?

02:59.446 --> 03:03.041
She's a mage
I respect very much.

03:08.155 --> 03:11.058
Have you studied
the Yokohama Treaty?

03:11.058 --> 03:18.555
Yes. It's the world's first treaty
created by you to protect mage rights.

03:18.732 --> 03:20.222
That's right.

03:21.068 --> 03:25.664
At the conclusion, your mother
helped me tremendously.

03:27.074 --> 03:34.981
And now, I'm meeting Kikuchi Etsuko's
daughter as a mage trainee.

03:35.015 --> 03:37.313
I'm deeply filled with emotion.

03:37.417 --> 03:38.884
Kikuchi Yume-san?

03:38.919 --> 03:39.908
Yes!

03:40.287 --> 03:43.950
Please become
a great mage, as well.

03:44.525 --> 03:46.083
Yes...

03:54.001 --> 03:56.265
I was so nervous.

03:57.638 --> 04:01.096
Master Chief Ginpun...
respects... Mama?

04:04.411 --> 04:07.107
She's just an ordinary,
middle-aged lady.

04:07.981 --> 04:12.111
"An Apron and Champagne"

04:17.257 --> 04:20.227
"So, it's called 'saury'?
How delicious!"

04:20.227 --> 04:22.457
"What a wonderful
place Meguro is!"

04:22.629 --> 04:26.121
"I'll take another serving."
"Yes, sir!"

04:27.935 --> 04:30.665
Calla lilies, as Takako liked...

04:30.804 --> 04:32.897
Another summer's here...

04:33.073 --> 04:38.477
And Masami-chan bought
calla lilies to take to Takako...

04:39.012 --> 04:40.479
That's right.

04:40.981 --> 04:46.044
If I were a mage, I'd wipe
calla lilies off the face of the earth.

04:48.522 --> 04:51.116
Oh, come on!
Don't make that sad face!

04:51.758 --> 04:52.816
I'm home!

04:53.060 --> 04:54.161
- Welcome back!

04:54.161 --> 04:55.389
- Welcome back!
- Welcome home!

04:56.763 --> 04:59.493
Oyamada-sensei...
I've just returned home.

04:59.533 --> 05:00.727
Thanks for your hard work.

05:01.435 --> 05:04.666
This pot of miniature roses
is from Master Chief Ginpun.

05:05.072 --> 05:09.736
It was a magnificent mansion,
and I was really nervous...

05:09.776 --> 05:11.243
But Master Chief was...

05:11.411 --> 05:15.507
So your new trainee's a girl again?
Masami-chan!

05:15.616 --> 05:17.174
Masami-chan?

05:17.551 --> 05:20.087
This is my new trainee,
Kikuchi Yume-san.

05:20.087 --> 05:22.555
Yume?
What a cute name!

05:23.056 --> 05:24.353
This is Milinda.

05:24.524 --> 05:26.515
Milinda-san,
very nice to meet you.

05:27.160 --> 05:28.354
Nice to meet you.

05:28.996 --> 05:33.194
Milinda's one of the DJ's at the bar,
but she took some time off.

05:33.300 --> 05:35.200
But I'm coming back.

05:35.902 --> 05:38.598
I'm Masami-chan's girlfriend.

05:39.740 --> 05:42.038
That's not how it is.

05:42.876 --> 05:46.113
Yume, it's no use having
a crush on Masami-chan.

05:46.113 --> 05:47.137
Um, uh...

05:47.881 --> 05:50.651
Yume, even though you just got back,
do you mind walking Runa home?

05:50.651 --> 05:53.153
"What a wonderful place Meguro is!"
Yume, even though you just got back,
do you mind walking Runa home?

05:53.153 --> 05:55.088
"I'll take another serving!"
"Yes, sir!"
It's getting late.

05:55.088 --> 05:56.146
"I'll take another serving!"
"Yes, sir!"
Oh, sure.

06:01.061 --> 06:06.099
Because Big Sister Milinda is
secretly in love with good ol' Oyamada.

06:06.099 --> 06:09.227
Secretly in love?
I see.

06:09.269 --> 06:11.760
But she shouldn't be
jealous of me.

06:12.239 --> 06:13.103
Right?

06:14.074 --> 06:16.065
Runa!

06:21.114 --> 06:25.852
Runa, why did you miss your English class?
Why is your cell phone turned off?

06:25.852 --> 06:29.253
What are you doing
in secret behind my back?

06:30.390 --> 06:31.254
Say something!

06:32.292 --> 06:34.260
Um, well, Ma...

06:34.561 --> 06:35.721
Call me "Mother"!

06:36.463 --> 06:39.433
Um, just a moment, please.

06:39.433 --> 06:42.736
You... Who are you?
Have you have been taking Runa around?

06:42.736 --> 06:44.237
No. How could I...

06:44.237 --> 06:46.034
She has nothing to do with this!

06:46.173 --> 06:50.803
I'm in training at the Oyamada Office
of Mage Labor, just down the street.

06:50.844 --> 06:54.280
Oyamada!
Not that bar again!

06:55.115 --> 06:58.607
Isn't it time you people stop
pulling a kid into a place like that?

06:58.919 --> 07:01.114
"Pull her in," you say?
Please!

07:01.154 --> 07:04.658
Anyway, just please
keep away from Runa!

07:04.658 --> 07:06.091
Runa, let's go home!

07:07.928 --> 07:09.520
Runa! Wait!

07:22.142 --> 07:23.210
I'm sorry.

07:23.210 --> 07:26.145
No, I'm the one.
I apologize.

07:30.584 --> 07:33.653
Huh?
That smells good!

07:33.653 --> 07:36.986
They're almost done.
Please take some back with you.

07:37.257 --> 07:39.157
Thank you very much.

07:39.259 --> 07:41.420
Fresh, home-made cookies...
What a treat!

07:41.495 --> 07:44.331
Everything's home-made
at our house.

07:44.331 --> 07:46.925
That's wonderful.
I envy Runa.

07:47.000 --> 07:52.495
Runa, I'll bring some to your room later.
So go ahead and study.

07:57.744 --> 08:01.680
Um... I'm sorry for saying such
awful things to you earlier.

08:01.715 --> 08:03.080
Oh, it's ok.

08:03.283 --> 08:07.254
That child doesn't
listen to me at all.

08:07.254 --> 08:10.348
Runa's a good girl,
always caring about her friends.

08:10.557 --> 08:12.354
She speaks funny.

08:12.993 --> 08:14.961
She doesn't act
like a child, does she?

08:25.539 --> 08:27.874
So then, you're a girl
from a rich family...

08:27.874 --> 08:29.842
Well, I'm not a boy
from a rich family.

08:30.677 --> 08:34.381
Back home,
it was just so messy...

08:34.381 --> 08:36.372
No fancy floors...

08:37.117 --> 08:38.379
Just a wood plank floor.

08:38.785 --> 08:41.379
My mama still spanks me.

08:41.688 --> 08:43.457
You spoiled brat!

08:43.457 --> 08:47.723
How many times do I have
to tell you to fold the laundry?

08:49.763 --> 08:51.697
You wouldn't think
it's the same Japan...

08:54.968 --> 08:57.070
I've never ever
used sunscreen.

08:57.070 --> 09:01.608
Me, neither. And it's too
much trouble to tie my hair.

09:01.608 --> 09:03.405
You tie it yourself?

09:03.977 --> 09:07.247
I'm the only one in class
who actually does it herself.

09:07.247 --> 09:08.009
Good for you.

09:08.381 --> 09:12.249
That's why I always look goofy.
I'm the only goofy one.

09:15.422 --> 09:20.416
Runa-chan, how about some cookies?
They look delicious.

09:21.061 --> 09:23.188
After I'm done with this.

09:27.033 --> 09:29.433
You have so many
traditional comedy CDs!

09:29.769 --> 09:33.865
Yeah, those are my ol' man's.
We listen to them together on his days off.

09:34.040 --> 09:37.410
I see. So that's why you
love traditional comedy so much.

09:37.410 --> 09:40.447
Yeah. I practice
all the time at Pachanga.

09:40.447 --> 09:44.451
And good ol' Oyamada and
Big Brother Kera listen to me carefully.

09:44.451 --> 09:47.320
I wanna be a traditional
comedian when I grow up,

09:47.320 --> 09:49.447
and invite my ol' man
to watch me on stage...

09:49.789 --> 09:50.949
And your mother, too?

09:51.992 --> 09:54.460
Ma never listens to
traditional comedy.

09:54.794 --> 09:58.230
She doesn't like
traditional comedy, my ma...

10:01.001 --> 10:03.970
When I first came here,
I was really shocked.

10:03.970 --> 10:07.107
But today Master Chief Ginpun's
house and Runa-chan's house...

10:07.107 --> 10:10.110
gave me real culture shock.

10:10.110 --> 10:11.975
But as it turned out,
Runa-chan's mother was...

10:12.112 --> 10:15.448
Boss! Milinda-san told me
to come get you.

10:15.448 --> 10:18.474
You're being paged.
I'm the messenger!

10:18.618 --> 10:20.687
Sorry about that!
I'll be gone for a while.

10:20.687 --> 10:21.813
Of course!
Go ahead.

10:22.389 --> 10:26.553
Well, Milinda-san chooses
some really cool tunes.

10:28.595 --> 10:32.497
"Milinda-san is secretly
in love with good ol' Oyamada..."

10:33.366 --> 10:36.202
How many times do I have to tell you?
Hurry up and throw them away!

10:36.202 --> 10:37.170
No! I don't want to!

10:37.170 --> 10:37.761
Runa!

10:58.725 --> 10:59.692
- Huh?
- Huh?

11:00.493 --> 11:03.519
Isn't she here, that child?
I thought for sure she'd be here.

11:03.830 --> 11:04.524
What happened?

11:04.731 --> 11:07.529
It's Runa. It's Runa!
She's missing!

11:17.143 --> 11:19.168
"I'm going to go be an apprentice.
Runa"

11:19.479 --> 11:21.538
Pachanga's off limits?

11:23.283 --> 11:26.013
"Don't come here."
Is that what you told Runa-chan?

11:26.386 --> 11:29.549
Yes.
And the CDs, too...

11:29.956 --> 11:31.821
CDs? You mean the
traditional comedy ones?

11:32.659 --> 11:35.719
We had a little quarrel over
whether or not to throw them away...

11:36.329 --> 11:38.559
Um... Where's Runa's father?

11:38.632 --> 11:42.168
I can't reach him. I can't
get through on his cell phone.

11:42.168 --> 11:43.567
He's already left work.

11:44.604 --> 11:47.240
Have you asked her classmates?

11:47.240 --> 11:50.343
Yes. But she's not
at their houses, either...

11:50.343 --> 11:52.278
Are there any other
places you can think of?

11:52.278 --> 11:55.577
Um, I'm not sure
where else she could be...

11:56.850 --> 12:00.253
Ugh! What does she mean by
"becoming an apprentice"?

12:00.253 --> 12:01.721
She's worrying all of us.

12:01.721 --> 12:05.592
I'm going with Runa-chan's
mother to look for her.

12:05.592 --> 12:08.584
Good! Thanks. Keep your
eyes open on my behalf, too.

12:08.995 --> 12:13.932
Since the mage police are looking,
too, I'm sure we'll find her soon, but...

12:13.967 --> 12:15.457
But?

12:16.236 --> 12:20.607
I'm hoping that Runa-chan's
mom will find her.

12:20.607 --> 12:24.210
Then it'll be easier for
Runa-chan to go home, right?

12:24.210 --> 12:27.441
I grew up in an orphanage.
So, I wouldn't know about that.

12:28.515 --> 12:32.281
But I think it's best that it's
the parent that finds her child.

12:32.786 --> 12:34.621
I didn't know.
I'm sorry.

12:34.621 --> 12:38.591
Don't be silly! Don't apologize
for something you didn't know.

12:38.591 --> 12:42.618
Besides, what you said is true.
So hurry and go with Runa-chan's mom.

12:42.796 --> 12:43.626
Yes!

12:47.534 --> 12:48.091
Let's go!

12:48.835 --> 12:52.138
Go? But I've already looked
everywhere I could think of.

12:52.138 --> 12:56.768
Anyway, let's look every
place we can. I'll help you.

12:57.143 --> 13:00.510
Sure. That's right.
You're a mage, too.

13:01.147 --> 13:04.776
With you next to me, we should
be able to find her quickly.

13:06.786 --> 13:11.155
Thank you for shopping here tonight...

13:15.729 --> 13:19.265
Now you say you won't
use Special Power for me?

13:19.265 --> 13:21.768
How are we supposed
to find her without Special Power?

13:21.768 --> 13:26.603
Like I said, my power will interfere
with Oyamada-sensei and his team.

13:27.407 --> 13:30.672
So, let's just walk everywhere
we can think of and ask around.

13:31.411 --> 13:33.436
That's absurd!
We can't find her like that!

13:34.080 --> 13:35.411
Don't you want to find her?

13:35.982 --> 13:39.349
I want to find her!
So, please use your power!

13:41.621 --> 13:45.658
It says, "I'm going to go be an apprentice."
To whom did she write that?

13:45.658 --> 13:46.556
Huh?

13:46.893 --> 13:48.520
It was addressed
to you, wasn't it?

13:48.828 --> 13:53.197
So, you should find her
and answer to her. Right?

13:54.701 --> 14:00.697
I'm sorry for my impertinence, but
I don't think my power is the solution.

14:01.207 --> 14:02.105
Why is that?

14:04.177 --> 14:08.204
I once ran away from home
when I was in grade school.

14:10.817 --> 14:13.386
I forgot why.

14:13.386 --> 14:15.355
But I just kept
walking and walking.

14:15.355 --> 14:19.382
I didn't know where I was going,
but I just kept walking...

14:23.463 --> 14:28.059
Yume!
Are you there? Yume!

14:29.402 --> 14:30.733
Yume...

14:41.014 --> 14:42.749
Let's go home.

14:42.749 --> 14:46.753
Mama found me
without using her power.

14:46.753 --> 14:48.421
I was so relieved.

14:48.421 --> 14:51.481
It made me feel like I was just
running late, and she came to get me...

14:53.259 --> 14:55.420
That's why I thought
Runa-chan would...

14:56.896 --> 14:58.921
I understand.
Let's go.

15:03.770 --> 15:08.264
Runa! Runa! Runa!

15:08.842 --> 15:10.173
Runa-chan!

15:10.243 --> 15:11.767
Runa-chaaan!

15:25.124 --> 15:27.660
I'll go look in
the shopping district.

15:27.660 --> 15:28.649
Ok!

15:36.035 --> 15:37.559
Shimo-Kitazawa
Shopping Street

16:10.503 --> 16:12.471
She's nowhere!
What shall I do?

16:13.106 --> 16:15.341
Is there anywhere else
you can think of?

16:15.341 --> 16:17.911
We've looked
everywhere I know of.

16:17.911 --> 16:19.606
Please don't give up.

16:21.581 --> 16:24.209
I don't know how in the world
this could have happened.

16:24.651 --> 16:26.920
Runa used to be
an easy child to raise.

16:26.920 --> 16:32.051
She was calm, quiet and obedient.
She listened to me very well.

16:33.059 --> 16:35.862
But she doesn't listen
to me at all anymore.

16:35.862 --> 16:39.127
When did she stop
listening to you?

16:39.565 --> 16:40.800
Huh?

16:40.800 --> 16:42.068
Um, well...

16:42.068 --> 16:43.870
Let me think...

16:43.870 --> 16:45.497
When did it begin, I wonder...

16:52.378 --> 16:53.546
Hey, ol' man!

16:53.546 --> 16:56.845
Whoa, amazing, Runa!
Call me that one more time!

16:57.383 --> 16:58.584
Hey, ol' man!

16:58.584 --> 17:00.882
Oh, I like that!

17:03.356 --> 17:07.093
Hey, ol' man, I can say
that tongue twister:

17:07.093 --> 17:10.063
"Peter Piper picked a peck
of pickled peppers..."

17:10.063 --> 17:12.031
Very good, Runa!

17:27.080 --> 17:28.775
Runa!

17:48.768 --> 17:52.772
I remembered when you started
imitating traditional comedy.

17:52.772 --> 17:56.538
It was way back when you,
Daddy, and I came here together.

17:58.344 --> 18:02.610
We listened to traditional comedy
by a professional storyteller, didn't we?

18:03.616 --> 18:06.219
When you said, "Hey, ol' man,"
Daddy was so excited.

18:06.219 --> 18:11.088
After that,
you started talking a lot.

18:12.625 --> 18:17.961
But I got mad when you started
imitating traditional comedians.

18:18.231 --> 18:21.462
I kept getting mad,
saying, "Listen to me!"

18:22.468 --> 18:23.366
I'm sorry.

18:30.276 --> 18:31.368
Mother...

18:32.211 --> 18:33.735
Call me "Ma" if you like.

18:45.058 --> 18:46.491
Mother!

19:06.379 --> 19:08.870
Get it now!
What a great deal!

19:09.315 --> 19:14.719
Today's special is "pre-cut"
pineapple chunks, so sweet and tasty!

19:19.659 --> 19:20.493
Excuse me...

19:20.493 --> 19:21.561
Yes?

19:21.561 --> 19:23.162
Are you Runa-chan's mom?

19:23.162 --> 19:23.719
What?

19:23.963 --> 19:27.091
I'm the DJ at Pachanga... Milinda!

19:29.435 --> 19:33.072
You had a heck of a time
with Runa-chan yesterday...

19:33.072 --> 19:34.801
I'm sorry she caused
so much trouble.

19:35.074 --> 19:36.541
Oh, no, I didn't
mean it that way.

19:37.043 --> 19:40.746
You did a great job.
So I wanted to salute your efforts.

19:40.746 --> 19:42.213
Here we go...

19:44.817 --> 19:45.875
Champagne?

19:46.719 --> 19:52.859
This store carries the fancy stuff, too.
I can't drink much, since I'm at work.

19:52.859 --> 19:56.362
But I thought you might've drunk
lots of champagne in your youth...

19:56.362 --> 19:57.522
Uh, well, yes...

19:57.730 --> 20:01.063
I totally forgot that
I used to enjoy champagne...

20:01.334 --> 20:05.737
Even grown women want a little praise
when they do a good job, right?

20:11.911 --> 20:16.749
Here... Your daughter was safe,
and Mom did a super job.

20:16.749 --> 20:18.842
You did your best.
Good for you!

20:19.352 --> 20:20.580
Cheers!

20:21.320 --> 20:22.548
Thank you.

20:26.826 --> 20:27.918
Oh, this is lovely!

20:34.600 --> 20:35.701
Hi, there!

20:35.701 --> 20:36.599
Hey!

20:41.374 --> 20:43.543
Your mother baked those again?

20:43.543 --> 20:45.238
Yep! She said
they were for all of you.

20:45.878 --> 20:47.607
Well, we'll need some plates!

20:48.781 --> 20:51.551
Your hair looks great!

20:51.551 --> 20:53.883
Ma styled it.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.614
Really?

20:55.988 --> 20:57.250
We're happy for you.

20:57.423 --> 20:58.981
You look so cute!

21:02.461 --> 21:03.462
Well, I gotta go.

21:03.462 --> 21:04.895
What? You're leaving so soon?

21:06.132 --> 21:09.124
I have to go to a comedy...
nah, English class!

21:20.246 --> 21:26.742
When I turn around, it's still there,

21:29.689 --> 21:36.060
The future I've been pursuing.

21:37.930 --> 21:46.963
I have something precious in my heart.

21:47.406 --> 21:51.775
Upon the still unseen blue and

21:52.945 --> 21:59.646
The floating clouds, I wished...

22:02.555 --> 22:04.420
Under the Blue Sky

22:04.724 --> 22:11.755
From that dream that we dreamed that day,

22:12.098 --> 22:19.004
Let's not wake up, and let's not stop...

22:21.440 --> 22:23.567
Under the Blue Sky

22:23.909 --> 22:30.439
Let's keep shining and moving on.

22:30.716 --> 22:38.020
The endless journey continues...

22:49.535 --> 22:51.503
PREVIEW

22:52.772 --> 22:58.074
What can I do?
I, who have nothing...

22:58.377 --> 23:00.004
You want power.

23:00.179 --> 23:02.248
I want power.

23:02.248 --> 23:06.947
Even a little bit is fine,
just for a little while...

23:07.953 --> 23:09.488
You want to help.

23:09.488 --> 23:11.590
I want to help!

23:11.590 --> 23:13.726
I've wished from
the bottom of my heart...

23:13.726 --> 23:15.094
Episode Six is "I Want to Be a Mage."

23:15.094 --> 23:17.396
"I Want to Be a Mage"
Episode Six is "I Want to Be a Mage."

23:17.396 --> 23:19.455
"I Want to Be a Mage"
I hope you look forward to it!
